The parameter layout and defaults are documented in aic_hardware.c at:
https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800/blob/516e3b087763d80c44f5e3b6d2dd63e0d925c91d/src/SDIO/patch/for_Amlogic/905x4/Android11/mod/vendor/amlogic/common/wifi_bt/bluetooth/aic/libbt/src/aic_hardware.c

AWTRIX represents the 104-byte configuration in BtService.cpp and uses the
recorded TC002 values -1 for aon_extra_sleep_duration_cpus and 0x113 for
aon_debug_level instead of the Amlogic defaults -2 and 0. All other fields
match those defaults. See docs/developers/tc002/bluetooth.md for field offsets
and independently pinned provenance. This attribution concerns parameter
data; no AIC controller firmware is included.
